// FProots RQ2 probe (experiments 2.2-2.4): reads each statically predicted bypass next to its
// protected sibling and posts the readings to /report on the local server. No automation is
// attached to the browser; trusted mouse and wheel input, when wanted, comes from the X server
// (XTest) after the page posts its "ready" record.
//
// Query: run=<id>&seq=<host,host,...>&idx=<i>&wait_input=<0|1>&reps=<n>
// Every reading is a list of repeats (to see per-call noise); a repeat is a JSON value or
// {"error": "..."}.
'use strict';
